{"run": 3, "id": 107, "dataset_kind": "relevant", "expect_refusal": false, "as_of": "2026-10-27", "status": "ok", "first_token_s": 4.988, "total_s": 5.004, "result": "answer", "citations": 2, "thread_id": "t-033a13d782ea", "cited_chunk_ids": ["98c79d67ffeaad00", "51d184e38dc7f8ce"], "cited_version_dates": ["2026-03-19", "2026-03-19"], "cost_usd": 0.0051597, "input_tokens": 38977, "output_tokens": 2524, "llm_calls": 12, "error_code": null, "answer_chars": 177, "answer": "Development 부서에서는 Fast Boot 제안을 이슈로 작성하고, 부서장과 CTO의 검토·승인을 받는다 [1]. 먼저 매니저와 아이디어를 논의하는 절차도 있다 [2].\n\n기준일 2026-10-27 · 근거 판 날짜 2026-03-19 · 출처: GitLab Handbook (CC BY-SA 4.0, 수정됨)", "cost_by_step": {"search/decompose_gate": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 599, "output_tokens": 17, "cost_usd": 6.84e-05, "llm_s": 0.913}, "classify/classify": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 1424, "output_tokens": 19, "cost_usd": 0.0001519, "llm_s": 0.973}, "search/decompose": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 597, "output_tokens": 120, "cost_usd": 0.0001197, "llm_s": 1.248}, "write_answer/answer": {"calls": 2, "input_tokens": 7842, "output_tokens": 351, "cost_usd": 0.0009597, "llm_s": 2.456}, "write_answer/answer_fast": {"calls": 2, "input_tokens": 8264, "output_tokens": 495, "cost_usd": 0.0010739, "llm_s": 3.034}, "judge/judge": {"calls": 2, "input_tokens": 7588, "output_tokens": 718, "cost_usd": 0.0011178, "llm_s": 4.106}, "ground/grounding": {"calls": 3, "input_tokens": 12663, "output_tokens": 804, "cost_usd": 0.0016683, "llm_s": 4.051}}, "cost_by_step_total_usd": 0.0051597, "embed_tokens": 26, "embed_calls": 1, "embed_cost_usd": 1.56e-06, "refuse_stage": null, "refuse_reason": null, "attempts": 1, "at": "2026-11-12T03:41:30+09:00"}
